WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.816
Take its tail rotor off?

00:00:01.826 --> 00:00:03.255
The body spins.

00:00:03.265 --> 00:00:04.958
Up top, the main rotor:

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.961
spinning wings that lift.

00:00:06.971 --> 00:00:09.525
The collective changes
every blade's angle at

00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:11.119
once, to climb.

00:00:11.129 --> 00:00:13.385
The cyclic tilts the disc, pointing its

00:00:13.395 --> 00:00:15.432
push forward or sideways.

00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:17.064
Both go through one part on the

00:00:17.074 --> 00:00:17.864
shaft:

00:00:17.874 --> 00:00:19.086
the swashplate.

00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:20.648
So why the tail rotor?

00:00:20.658 --> 00:00:22.761
Turning the main rotor tries to twist

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:24.286
the body the other way.

00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:26.421
The little rotor pushes back.
